    <h1>AI Design Note</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"48=
0ada4a-14a5-4a07-8942-58b71f9441e9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d92c9f9f4421">
<th data-local-id=3D"704728d99787" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e6b2a9cc4bcc"><strong>Category</strong></p>
</th>
<th data-local-id=3D"304c7c962aec" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c8e855debced"><strong>Details</strong></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c39baa0dec5f">
<td data-local-id=3D"949839997b3f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"087f4fd09b14">AI Model</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73a18eaba90f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"92d4baa2930d">Ollama version llama3.2, Langsearch</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"01d1c2a77bbc">
<td data-local-id=3D"af40d576b487" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"010e575b26f2">Planned Tools</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9c317aaa7950" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"796af7954cc8">Python, LangSearch (Tentative =E2=80=93 subjec=
t to change), and other tools to be finalized.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7dd1d55be184">
<td data-local-id=3D"0aa00b3cc097" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"16765bc9ad00">AI Instructions</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"64ac21f4535e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ab0dfa0ffd41">=E2=80=9CHow to connect Ollama to Python=E2=80=
=9D</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"23193b51f45f">
<td data-local-id=3D"895a193cee79" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3339037b5d4f">Document Access</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ee8beb8e334e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"707c9cb25618">The AI model does not directly access or read =
the entire diary vault. Instead, the retrieval system searches and retrieve=
s relevant diary entries based on the user's question. Only the retrieved i=
nformation is provided to the AI model to generate responses.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c7175e901e86">
<td data-local-id=3D"4c83d1163002" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10461107b096">AI Purpose</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01a127493c36" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"161d64d28aec">To provide an AI-powered diary that allows use=
rs to record personal memories, reflect on their experiences, and retrieve =
meaningful information from their past entries through AI-assisted conversa=
tions.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"8e6e57a2ec26"></p>
    </div>
